WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.260
Please! Take me with you to
Black Pampas Grass!

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.600
At the very least, I want to
avenge Shishio! Please!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:13.930
Take me with you!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.280
Concentrate on protecting
Karasumori for now.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.870
Think about how you can
make your powers truly yours.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.140
Make them mine?

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.120
If your powers control you instead,

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.590
you cannot be called
a full-fledged Caster.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.650
Damn it!

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.960
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.100
Yoshimori was not allowed to
go to Black Pampas Grass,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.130
so he trained on his own to become
a more powerful Kekkaishi.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.370
Shortly after that,

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:48.400
a mysterious group
surrounded Yoshimori and Tokine.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.070
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:53.840
They're fast!

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.300
This sound...

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.370
They're human...

00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.180
Are they from the Kokuboro?

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.990
Hakubi, are there just three?

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.780
Oh, no! There are lots more, honey.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:09.820
Here they come!

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.730
We're surrounded!
How many of them are there?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.300
Yoshimori, we have to split up!

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.200
Yoshimori!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.530
Don't be fixated on
only what you can see...

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:28.880
Feel. Feel it!

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.140
Accept it.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.820
Accept things as they are...

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.730
Ketsu! Ketsu Ketsu
Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu!

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:44.130
Wow! He's faster
and more accurate!

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.130
How about that?! Take this!

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:51.940
Stop right there, Yoshimori.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:58.280
Hey. Your reflexes are quicker

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:00.250
but you still need to be
more vigilant.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.840
Masamori-san!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.110
Older Brother!

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:06.910
That's mean!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:10.220
You should've told your brother
ahead of time.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.530
- Hello, Chief!
- Hello, Chief!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.140
We still have other jobs
backlogged,

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.940
but we've decided to move
the headquarters of the Night Troops here

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.340
because of the Kokuboro.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.640
Wait a second!

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.280
Well, since that's that,
we're much obliged to you.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.010
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:45.660
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.530
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:52.730
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.630
(Fighting late into the night)

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.070
Drive away all hesitation

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.480
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.010
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.350
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:15.020
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.520
Sha la la la la...

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.930
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.900
(Secret romance)

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:33.110
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.870
(A strange distance)

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:41.710
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.780
Yeah

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.250
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.860
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:55.190
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.470
I'm home!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.610
I'm sleepy.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.210
Welcome back, Yoshimori.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.350
I have some snacks for you,
so come on in!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.640
Snacks...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.820
- Welcome back!
- Welcome back!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.060
Here you go.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.400
Oh, thank you.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.070
What's with this weird sense
of proportion?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.510
This teacup obviously
looks smaller than usual...

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.110
He's huge!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.150
Yes?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.990
Your eyebrows are identical!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.860
What was that?

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:06.000
He's the head cook
for the Night Troops.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.290
Oh...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.300
Here's your tea.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:13.030
Dad's really excited...

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:14.730
Hey...

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.440
Wasn't it your deadline today?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.340
What about your job?

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.340
You don't have to worry.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.380
That's grownup stuff.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.950
Are we going to live
like this for a while?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.520
With this many around,
I can't relax...

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.190
On top of that,
they're all Specially-Talented.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.130
Also, I definitely feel like
they're glaring at me.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:48.380
I guess if they all trust Big Bro
like Shishio did,

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.640
they probably don't like me.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.280
Yoshi, help me move
the futon later.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.880
Hm? Sure...

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:09.190
Yoshi, can I put my stuff here?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.630
Hey, Toshimori! Help me!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.470
I guess it is small for two people.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.040
I'm sorry, Yoshi.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.030
They're going to use
my room for the kids.

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:26.810
I don't mind.
But you on the other hand...

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.540
I have to go to
work late at night.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.520
I'll try not to make
too much noise,

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.080
I apologize beforehand
if I wake you up.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.720
I don't mind.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.630
Since I can't join you in battle,

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.030
I'll put up with that
at the very least.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.250
Toshimori...

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.270
Say, Yoshi.
I want to do my homework.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:47.730
Can I use your desk?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.270
Huh? Yoshi?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.110
What's with him?

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:55.830
He's being overly considerate...

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.110
Oh, my. Thank you so much.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.980
You're our guests.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.020
It's all right.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.220
You're our hosts,
so this is the least we can do.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.960
We're lucky to have women
as our guests!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:20.160
Oh my, Tokine.
Our house will be so clean!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.870
Auntie! Auntie!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:23.910
Yes?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.570
The potty! Someone's using
both of them right now!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.970
Oh, no.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.540
He's gotta go!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.110
Excuse me.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.540
Yes?

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:39.410
Atora-san isn't here?

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:46.020
Oh... Hanashima will be based out
of Shishio's apartment.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.630
Gen-kun's...

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.340
There's no point in thinking
too much.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.770
I should just get my body moving
to clear my mind.

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:06.280
Go ahead and hit
my magic pitch if you can!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.570
Bring it on!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.550
Oh, do you need to use this?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.980
It's all right.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.740
Watch out!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.990
Ouch...

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:26.330
Are you really
the Chief's little brother?

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:32.230
You couldn't even block my super,
sudden death Invisi-Kick.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.800
You're a nice little kid,
aren't you?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.270
Get over here!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:45.140
Akira. Apologize to him.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:46.380
But...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:52.780
I'm sorry.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.460
I'm so sorry for what he did.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.560
No worries...

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.800
They may be small,

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.070
but they still have
special abilities.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.350
Oh, fine.
I guess I'll train at the dojo.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.400
What?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.400
Oh, would you like to join us?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.730
No, thanks...

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.470
Join them... in what?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.000
Wait, I have nowhere to go.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.130
How long are you going
to stay here?

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.450
I don't know.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.320
At the very least,
until I finish this cup of tea.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.430
Damn it!
That's not what I meant!

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:06.990
Then what?

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.120
Those guys.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.400
What? Did you get into a fight?

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:11.830
No.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.770
Then there shouldn't
be any problems.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:18.570
No, that's not what I'm saying.
I just...

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.210
You just don't like it?

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:22.440
Uh...

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.450
You think you can protect
the Karasumori Site

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.820
from the Kokuboro alone?

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:30.190
Shut up!
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:31.580
Wait. Yoshimori.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:35.750
The Kokuboro is not just
your enemy anymore.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.190
I know!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.770
Get up, Madarao.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.540
How long are you going to sleep?!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.170
Damn it.
What's with you at this hour?

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:55.880
You're so bossy!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.420
I'm still sleepy, you know.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.720
Shut up! Let's go!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:05.890
What's with you?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.430
You seem really pumped up today.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:09.220
Hmph!

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.570
I'm not going to let
my damn brother

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.930
mess with me any longer!

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.560
This is my workplace!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.400
I'm not going to let anyone
get in my way at Karasumori!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.410
- Hello!
- Hello!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.710
Hey!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:25.670
What are you all doing here?!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:28.780
U-Um, we're under
the Chief's orders.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.370
Of my brother's?!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.190
A couple of us are going
to take turns

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:37.120
guarding and training
at Karasumori.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.630
- Oh...
- Oh...

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.890
But don't worry.
We're just assistants.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.860
We'll be supporting you two,
so fight however you please.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:50.160
The first ones at bat are us four!

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:52.710
Night Troops Battle Squad:

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.340
Todoroki, the homerun batter!

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.010
Ditto,

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.270
Makio, the shadowmaster!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.710
Takemitsu of the four-eyed
single sword-style!

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:05.080
I'm Hakota, the lookout.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.280
- Pleased to meet you!
- Pleased to meet you!

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:28.440
What's your problem?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.350
Why are you sulking?
You really are a petty little man!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.120
Who're you calling little?

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.450
Say that again,
you ghost mutt!

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:39.350
What?! How dare you!
I'm trying to help you out here!

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:40.980
It's none of your business!

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:43.220
Hey, cut it out.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.690
Yoshi. Abuse of power
is a bad thing.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.660
P-Power what?

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:51.860
Damn it, you're a Japanese dog,
don't use English words.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.100
Use Hiragana.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:56.930
Can't you see that they're here
to help us out?

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.300
I know that.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.940
I know they're on our side.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:06.440
We need to help each other
and we need more people here.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.370
But protecting Karasumori
is our job!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:11.890
It makes it really hard for me

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.480
when they just come
barging in like this!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:17.660
Well, we're not used to
working as a team,

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.130
but without Gen-kun now,

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.820
there's no way we can protect
Karasumori on our own.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.460
Which reminds me,
you said something similar

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.230
when that Half-Ayakashi boy
first came here.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.840
You're joking right?

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:37.070
The Legitimate Heir's Kekkai
can't be this weak.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.050
As far as I can tell,

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.110
Kekkaishi are the most
powerful Casters in existence.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:46.690
But you...

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.660
You're completely different.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:53.760
Right... You were so irritated
back then.

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:57.630
You wanted to get rid of him
like he was some kind of disease.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:00.660
But in the end, you all got along.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:02.940
That's right.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.200
A lot happened,
but you ended up being friends.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.340
It's the same this time.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.930
You'll get used to it soon.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.970
With him, it was...

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.050
Hey everyone!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.850
The Ayakashi are here!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.730
Is it the Kokuboro?!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.760
I doubt it.
It doesn't smell like them.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:31.960
Seems like it.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.100
It's not the Kokuboro?

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.730
Then we don't need to do it.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.270
Let them take care of it.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.010
It doesn't matter what
kind of Ayakashi it is.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.440
A job is a job.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.800
Didn't you say "protecting
Karasumori is our job"?!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.910
Yeah, I did!
But that's before they came!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.310
You really disappoint me...

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:56.050
Have it your way! Let's go, Hakubi!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.290
Come on, Yoshimori!
What are you going to do?!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:13.200
Ketsu!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:17.870
Honey!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.120
Are you all right?!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.450
Thank you.

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:29.050
Ketsu!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:34.250
I'll take them out one by one.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.990
Please help me.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.290
Understood!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:37.990
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.140
Come on. Why are you sulking?

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.660
Everyone is working really hard.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.460
Tokine!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.870
Oh? So you're going after all.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.640
You should've calmly done that
from the beginning.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:55.140
Shut up! I changed my mind!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.420
Okay, okay... whatever you say!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.580
Wait for me, Tokine!
I'm coming to help!

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.980
I'll show all of them what
I'm made of!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:06.980
All right!

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.900
Right down the center!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.290
Ketsu!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.290
Tenketsu!

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:27.210
Looks like they showed you
what they're made of.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:35.480
Wow, it only took them
one hit each.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:39.990
Is he really the Legitimate Heir?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.080
Yoshimori, what are you doing here?

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:46.380
Nothing...
Just getting some rest.

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:48.490
Are you tired?

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:50.700
Maybe you should take
the night off.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:55.700
I mean, did you see those
Night Troops last night?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:00.270
They were amazing!
They're so dependable.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.810
I don't think it will be a problem
if you're not there.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.550
If you're not feeling well,

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:07.150
you should forget about Karasumori

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.740
and take this chance
to get some rest.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.980
We'll be fine on our own
for a little bit...

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.310
What's wrong?

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.790
Hey!
That's not the way home.

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:26.330
I'm going for a walk...

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:28.690
Huh?

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.370
Oh! Did I just...

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:38.140
...wound Yoshimori's pride?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.410
This was Shishio's...

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:22.450
Huh?!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.230
Oh?! If it isn't Yoshimori-kun!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:32.330
W-Why are you here, Atora-san?

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.630
It's been a while since
we talked like this.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.300
I think the last time was
during that test.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.570
Here.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:48.470
By the way,
how's your cake-making going?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:50.440
Have you made any new ones?

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:54.290
No... I haven't been baking
any cakes recently...

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.990
What?! Why?! It was so good!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.090
Um...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:00.750
What?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:04.660
Nothing...

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.670
Oh? Could it be?

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.340
You want to take a bath with me,
don't you?!

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.070
That's not it!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.880
I'm kidding... So what is it?

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.840
Um...

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.310
I'm sorry!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.640
Huh?

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.750
If I was stronger,
Shishio might not have...

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:38.730
Dummy... It's not your fault
that Gen died.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.300
But I...

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:44.960
Yoshimori-kun...
I'm actually jealous of you.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:46.200
What?

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:50.440
He smiled in
his last moments, right?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:55.110
He never smiled for me even once.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:16.470
I wish I could've seen
his smiling face.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.390
What am I doing?

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:51.040
Shishio! I won't lose
sight of my way again!

00:22:21.970 --> 00:22:23.270
What do you want?

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.720
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:59.630
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:02.170
"What nerve"

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:05.550
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:09.280
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:15.650
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:20.690
I hate studying,
I like P.E. okay

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:22.630
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:27.900
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:31.430
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:35.530
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:50.020 --> 00:24:00.370
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
